                 <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                  <size>
                   <width>0</width>
                   <height>0</height>
                  </size>
                 </property>
                 </spacer>
                </item>
                <item>
                 <widget class="QLabel" name="clusterDistanceHelp">
                  <property name="text">
                   <string>Rows are source elements; columns are target elements. Each cell gives the mean distance from source clusters to their nearest target cluster. The standard deviation describes the spread of individual distances, with the same scaling as the mean.</string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="wordWrap">
                   <bool>true</bool>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item>
                 <widget class="QLabel" name="clusterDistanceNullHelp">
                  <property name="text">
                   <string>The null model compares the observed distances with those expected if clusters were randomly scattered across the areas occupied by any of the clustered elements. Each element keeps its observed number of clusters, but their positions are randomized independently.

Expected distances and percentiles are estimated from 1,000 random arrangements (with a fixed seed). All clustered elements define the available area, including those hidden by the cluster-count filter.

Normalized distances are observed means divided by their random expectations. Percentiles give the percentage of random arrangements with a smaller mean distance than observed.</string>
                  </property>
                  <property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
                <item>
                 <widget class="QLabel" name="clusterDistanceStatus">
                  <property name="sizePolicy">
                   <sizepolicy hsizetype="Preferred" vsizetype="Maximum">
                    <horstretch>0</horstretch>
                    <verstretch>0</verstretch>
                   </sizepolicy>
                  </property>
                  <property name="text">
                   <string />
                  </property>
                  <property name="wordWrap">
                   <bool>true</bool>
                  </property>
                 </widget>
                </item>
               </layout>
              </widget>
